# Copy this file to manage-demo-vms.env (gitignored - see .gitignore) and
# fill in the real value. manage-demo-vms.ps1 reads ARM_SUBSCRIPTION_ID from
# here as its -SubscriptionId default when the flag isn't passed explicitly.
#
# This mirrors the ARM_SUBSCRIPTION_ID GitHub secret that
# .github/workflows/citrix-image-rotation.yml's azure/login steps use for
# OIDC federated login - but GitHub secrets are write-only (no script/CLI can
# read one back once set), so this local file is how ad-hoc tooling outside
# CI gets the same subscription ID. Must point at the Lab subscription, same
# as the GitHub secret - never a production subscription.
ARM_SUBSCRIPTION_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
